nty","/arc-plc/california/lake-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Lake County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids, May to June came in under 90% of normal in 45 of those years, and in 2025 it came in at 18%. For 2026 so far, April to May came in at 145% on the middle of the grids. Grid 22230 had its driest year in 2013, at 21% of normal.</p>"}
